+**Printed-payment example:** Captain's Basic Repairs has an extra cost of **2**. Discard **Basic Repairs itself + 2 other Action cards = 3 Action cards total**. Those three cards are sufficient for its printed Action-card payment; Contamination cannot replace any of them. The card's separate requirements, including Out of Combat, still apply.
